  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h3>About Our Brand and Products</h3><p>We create premium, science-backed health and wellness products designed to help people feel, perform, and live at their best. Every formula is crafted with high-quality ingredients and built on transparency, innovation, and results.</p><h3>What Makes Us Different</h3><p>Unlike many brands, we prioritize evidence-based formulations, ethical sourcing, and education for our customers. We’re committed to empowering healthier lifestyles, not just selling products — and that makes us a trusted name in the industry.</p><h3>How Affiliates Can Earn</h3><p>Affiliates receive a <strong>10% coupon code</strong> to share with their audience, giving their followers instant savings. On top of that, affiliates earn <strong>20% cashback commission</strong> on every sale made through their link or coupon code. It’s a win-win: customers save, and you get rewarded generously.</p><h3>How to Promote Us</h3><ul><li><p>Share your unique affiliate coupon code with your audience.</p></li><li><p>Create authentic content around your personal experience with our products.</p></li><li><p>Leverage social media, blogs, email lists, or videos to drive awareness.</p></li><li><p>Highlight both the <strong>discount for customers</strong> and the <strong>cashback opportunity for you</strong>.</p></li></ul><h3>Other Information</h3><p>Tracking is automated through our affiliate platform, so you’ll always know your performance in real time.</p></div></div>",
